WEBVTT

00:00:11.788 --> 00:00:14.291
It's burning! It's burning!

00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:17.124
I hate you... I hate you all!

00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:25.628
Miss Accela...

00:00:27.437 --> 00:00:35.178
Nee ima made shiritakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki

00:00:35.178 --> 00:00:41.606
Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de

00:00:43.353 --> 00:00:53.330
Bokura wa marude
ichimai-chigai no guuzen o sagashiatte

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.498
Meguriatta

00:00:55.498 --> 00:01:03.606
Kimi ga itsuka nomikonda sono kotoba yori

00:01:03.606 --> 00:01:12.515
Zutto iezu ni itekureteta yasashisa o

00:01:12.515 --> 00:01:19.489
Shinjitai to ima omounda

00:01:19.489 --> 00:01:27.230
Nee kono saki wa doko made
mo fuan to tonari-awase

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:33.636
Nakusu mono ga nakatta
bokutachi wa mou inai

00:01:33.636 --> 00:01:41.344
Nee ima made shiranakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki

00:01:41.344 --> 00:01:47.650
Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:51.552
Tsumikasanete yuku mono

00:01:59.329 --> 00:01:59.496
You're going to the RUC?

00:01:59.496 --> 00:02:01.398
"My Feelings, Her Feelings,
and the Girl's Feelings"
You're going to the RUC?

00:02:01.398 --> 00:02:03.833
"My Feelings, Her Feelings,
and the Girl's Feelings"
Things have gotten out of hand.

00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:05.969
I can't very well ignore it.

00:02:05.969 --> 00:02:07.070
Besides...

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:08.035
Besides?

00:02:08.035 --> 00:02:10.771
If Rose is working with Ashley,

00:02:10.771 --> 00:02:13.273
I have to stop her.

00:02:13.273 --> 00:02:15.241
I have a responsibility as her parent.

00:02:17.144 --> 00:02:18.478
We do, as well.

00:02:18.478 --> 00:02:21.882
Our sister's indiscretion is our
responsibility as her older brothers.

00:02:21.882 --> 00:02:23.183
Yeah.

00:02:23.183 --> 00:02:27.487
H-Hey, be careful, okay.

00:02:27.487 --> 00:02:29.389
Don't do anything too reckless.

00:02:29.389 --> 00:02:30.991
We know.

00:02:30.991 --> 00:02:33.927
Miranda, take care of things
while we're gone.

00:02:33.927 --> 00:02:35.062
Leave it to me.

00:02:35.062 --> 00:02:36.997
You too, Yuto.

00:02:36.997 --> 00:02:38.065
Got it.

00:02:38.065 --> 00:02:41.201
That leaves the question
of how do we get in?

00:02:41.201 --> 00:02:44.304
Going in separately will be highly risky.

00:02:44.304 --> 00:02:46.540
But we're a small group...

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.575
If we go in together
and become surrounded,

00:02:48.575 --> 00:02:49.776
we don't stand a chance.

00:02:49.776 --> 00:02:51.478
Um...

00:02:51.478 --> 00:02:54.848
Then I will be your decoy.

00:02:54.848 --> 00:02:56.283
Decoy?

00:02:56.283 --> 00:02:57.851
A diversionary tactic?

00:02:57.851 --> 00:03:01.888
Yes. I will create a
commotion above ground.

00:03:01.888 --> 00:03:03.457
You can use that chance to...

00:03:03.457 --> 00:03:04.791
Don't be absurd!

00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:08.095
We can't use a woman,
much less a child, as a decoy.

00:03:08.095 --> 00:03:11.031
L-I am a Proceed, too.

00:03:11.031 --> 00:03:12.966
I've had combat training.

00:03:12.966 --> 00:03:15.836
And right now, I can make
the RUC people believe

00:03:15.836 --> 00:03:20.340
that I've come to avenge my colleagues.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.675
It's not a bad idea.

00:03:21.675 --> 00:03:22.876
But...

00:03:22.876 --> 00:03:26.004
Do you have a better plan?

00:03:28.415 --> 00:03:31.485
But let's say we go with that plan...

00:03:31.485 --> 00:03:33.487
We'll still need to send someone with her.

00:03:33.487 --> 00:03:37.024
We can't very well let her
be the decoy by herself.

00:03:37.024 --> 00:03:39.026
Oh, I can manage alone...

00:03:39.026 --> 00:03:40.394
Me.

00:03:40.394 --> 00:03:42.095
I will go with her.

00:03:42.095 --> 00:03:43.363
Solty...

00:03:43.363 --> 00:03:44.264
What?

00:03:44.264 --> 00:03:47.334
I will go with Miss Accela.

00:03:47.334 --> 00:03:49.029
Is that okay, Miss Accela?

00:03:50.604 --> 00:03:52.506
Okay.

00:03:52.506 --> 00:03:54.207
Solty!

00:03:54.207 --> 00:03:56.443
We have to do this, right?

00:03:56.443 --> 00:03:57.544
Do not worry.

00:03:57.544 --> 00:04:00.247
I will protect Miss Accela!

00:04:00.247 --> 00:04:03.148
She'll make a suitable bodyguard.

00:04:04.651 --> 00:04:07.487
If it becomes dangerous,
get out immediately.

00:04:07.487 --> 00:04:08.689
Right!

00:04:08.689 --> 00:04:12.125
Let us do our best, Miss Accela.

00:04:12.125 --> 00:04:13.353
Right...

00:04:17.631 --> 00:04:22.135
That's right! The truth is,
I used you as my decoys!

00:04:22.135 --> 00:04:25.502
So I could put myself
in this little baby!

00:04:32.145 --> 00:04:36.416
So if we get on this, we can
make it straight to the surface?

00:04:36.416 --> 00:04:37.405
Yes.

00:04:42.789 --> 00:04:44.984
Okay, let us go, Miss Accela.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:47.694
Miss Accela?

00:04:47.694 --> 00:04:48.922
I'm sorry.

00:04:50.597 --> 00:04:51.825
Miss Accela!

00:04:54.501 --> 00:04:56.969
Miss Accela! Miss Accela!

00:05:17.758 --> 00:05:18.952
The buildings...

00:05:20.026 --> 00:05:21.357
...are shaking.

00:05:41.548 --> 00:05:43.209
Miss Accela...

00:05:44.684 --> 00:05:45.708
Solty...

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:51.291
Solty, if my guess is correct,

00:05:51.291 --> 00:05:54.194
your powers should have returned by now.

00:05:54.194 --> 00:05:55.559
Am I wrong?

00:05:59.032 --> 00:06:00.556
My powers...

00:06:10.243 --> 00:06:12.345
Hey, what're these tremors?

00:06:12.345 --> 00:06:13.980
What's going on?!

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.183
You needn't concern yourself.

00:06:16.183 --> 00:06:18.652
You concentrate on your work.

00:06:18.652 --> 00:06:21.621
How can I?! It bothers me!

00:06:21.621 --> 00:06:24.157
Those are the division chief's orders!

00:06:24.157 --> 00:06:25.325
Sheesh!

00:06:25.325 --> 00:06:28.228
Division chief this, division chief that!

00:06:28.228 --> 00:06:32.699
You think you just have to mention Ashley
to make me obey, don't you?

00:06:32.699 --> 00:06:34.633
If that's how you want to play...

00:06:36.269 --> 00:06:38.897
Open external surveillance monitor.

00:06:42.242 --> 00:06:44.733
Wh-What... is this?!

00:06:46.379 --> 00:06:49.549
Damn! What's up with these tremors?!

00:06:49.549 --> 00:06:51.312
Hell if I know!

00:06:55.422 --> 00:06:56.890
Resembles...

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:59.226
They sure are a damn nuisance!

00:06:59.226 --> 00:07:00.393
Don't kill them now.

00:07:00.393 --> 00:07:02.028
They're just being manipulated.

00:07:02.028 --> 00:07:03.330
I know!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.354
This way!

00:07:10.003 --> 00:07:12.005
Take this with you.

00:07:12.005 --> 00:07:14.941
That thing you sent to me?

00:07:14.941 --> 00:07:16.610
What is it?

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:22.816
The activation key to the
subsystem room in the RUC basement.

00:07:22.816 --> 00:07:24.017
With that,

00:07:24.017 --> 00:07:30.223
you can stall the RUC's main system
for a while from the subsystem room.

00:07:30.223 --> 00:07:32.092
Well, well...

00:07:32.092 --> 00:07:33.426
What's the matter?

00:07:33.426 --> 00:07:35.362
I don't get it.

00:07:35.362 --> 00:07:39.866
Why do you have something
like this, old man?

00:07:39.866 --> 00:07:44.437
I snuck it out when I left the RUC.

00:07:44.437 --> 00:07:48.108
I thought it might hinder
Ashley's ambitions,

00:07:48.108 --> 00:07:49.109
even if only for a bit.

00:07:49.109 --> 00:07:52.145
You knew, didn't you?

00:07:52.145 --> 00:07:56.216
I couldn't stop him.

00:07:56.216 --> 00:08:02.355
With that, you can completely
shut down RUC, if only temporarily.

00:08:02.355 --> 00:08:05.153
You can probably
catch Ashley off his guard.

00:08:05.926 --> 00:08:08.690
I understand. I'll make good use of it.

00:08:15.035 --> 00:08:17.771
D-D-Destroy... I'll destroy it all.

00:08:17.771 --> 00:08:24.044
With this baby you built,
I'll destroy your hopes and you with it!

00:08:24.044 --> 00:08:25.602
Ashley Lynx!

00:08:46.299 --> 00:08:47.934
Miss Accela!

00:08:47.934 --> 00:08:51.604
Miss Accela! That is you in there, right?!

00:08:51.604 --> 00:08:53.006
Solty...

00:08:53.006 --> 00:08:54.240
Please stop this!

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.936
Doing this will not achieve anything!

00:08:58.678 --> 00:09:01.881
People I cared about were taken from me!

00:09:01.881 --> 00:09:03.516
Miss Accela!

00:09:03.516 --> 00:09:06.178
Get out of the way!
I can't stop this anymore!

00:09:27.207 --> 00:09:30.276
Honestly! Reckless as ever, I see.

00:09:30.276 --> 00:09:31.641
Miss Rose!

00:09:50.397 --> 00:09:54.067
D-Damn them! They destroyed our shops!

00:09:54.067 --> 00:09:56.092
Fire! Fire! Fight back!

00:10:02.976 --> 00:10:05.145
Now's your chance to run! Hurry!

00:10:05.145 --> 00:10:06.379
Come on, let's go!

00:10:06.379 --> 00:10:07.937
Y-You're...

00:10:09.149 --> 00:10:11.651
Are they unregistered residents?!

00:10:11.651 --> 00:10:12.986
That's right.

00:10:12.986 --> 00:10:14.587
But why?

00:10:14.587 --> 00:10:17.590
I thought you guys
despised registered residents.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:21.494
We have to help each other out
in times of need, right?

00:10:21.494 --> 00:10:23.655
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:41.981 --> 00:10:44.084
Take that!

00:10:44.084 --> 00:10:46.820
That wasn't really necessary.

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:51.124
You can't be soft, Yuto,
or you'll be killed!

00:10:51.124 --> 00:10:54.994
Uh, I rescued you
just a minute ago, remember?

00:10:54.994 --> 00:10:57.630
Oh, did you?

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:59.132
Forget it.

00:10:59.132 --> 00:11:03.269
And it looks like we'll be able
to successfully rescue Integra.

00:11:03.269 --> 00:11:05.738
Hurry! This way! Quickly!

00:11:05.738 --> 00:11:06.473
Kasha!

00:11:06.473 --> 00:11:07.235
Huh?

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:12.178
Mom!

00:11:12.178 --> 00:11:13.746
Got you, too!

00:11:13.746 --> 00:11:14.974
I want to help!

00:11:22.455 --> 00:11:23.790
Ouch.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:26.726
Kasha, you mustn't be reckless.

00:11:26.726 --> 00:11:30.296
But I guess riot gear
is nothing to sneeze at.

00:11:30.296 --> 00:11:32.499
It's pretty useful.

00:11:32.499 --> 00:11:34.868
You're my daughter, all right.

00:11:34.868 --> 00:11:37.403
But at this rate,
this is a battle of attrition.

00:11:37.403 --> 00:11:39.272
We don't know how long we can hold out.

00:11:39.272 --> 00:11:42.764
Yes, I hope it ends before then...

00:11:47.147 --> 00:11:48.341
What's that?

00:11:50.316 --> 00:11:52.218
You're kidding! Those, too?

00:11:52.218 --> 00:11:53.947
Are they being controlled, as well?

00:12:09.235 --> 00:12:11.337
Rose...

00:12:11.337 --> 00:12:13.840
I was watching.
I didn't know you could fly.

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:17.343
Oh, yes, but only very recently.

00:12:17.343 --> 00:12:20.280
So, who's at the controls of that thing?

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:22.815
I think Miss Accela
is probably controlling it.

00:12:22.815 --> 00:12:25.418
We have to hurry up and stop her somehow.

00:12:25.418 --> 00:12:28.021
I see. So it's Accela.

00:12:28.021 --> 00:12:30.857
Rose Anderson!

00:12:30.857 --> 00:12:33.660
Commencing energy recharge.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:34.786
Miss Rose!

00:12:36.696 --> 00:12:39.199
Sorry, Accela,

00:12:39.199 --> 00:12:41.501
but I'm going to put a quick stop to this.

00:12:41.501 --> 00:12:42.661
Miss Rose!

00:12:47.707 --> 00:12:48.908
Not yet?!

00:12:48.908 --> 00:12:50.276
They won't stop coming!

00:12:50.276 --> 00:12:51.834
I know!

00:12:55.315 --> 00:12:56.441
Andy!

00:12:58.818 --> 00:13:00.080
Bro?!

00:13:03.189 --> 00:13:05.558
Get inside!

00:13:05.558 --> 00:13:07.060
Bro, are you all right?!

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.061
Yeah...

00:13:08.061 --> 00:13:09.929
Damn it!

00:13:09.929 --> 00:13:11.397
Stop getting in our way!

00:13:11.397 --> 00:13:13.032
Damn it!

00:13:13.032 --> 00:13:14.667
Hey!

00:13:14.667 --> 00:13:15.802
Bro?!

00:13:15.802 --> 00:13:19.439
Go! Put an end to this stupid struggle!

00:13:19.439 --> 00:13:20.473
Bro?!

00:13:20.473 --> 00:13:22.375
Bro!!

00:13:22.375 --> 00:13:25.538
Take care of Andy and Rose for me, Roy.

00:13:29.182 --> 00:13:32.640
I'm not as nice as those other two!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.984
Bro...

00:13:47.667 --> 00:13:49.532
We're almost there.

00:13:53.206 --> 00:13:54.707
Damn!

00:13:54.707 --> 00:13:58.044
We can go all out against these things!

00:13:58.044 --> 00:14:00.478
Yeah, let's do it!

00:14:01.848 --> 00:14:03.883
Please stop, Miss Rose!

00:14:03.883 --> 00:14:05.578
Stay clear, Solty!

00:14:10.923 --> 00:14:12.458
Solty...

00:14:12.458 --> 00:14:16.129
Energy charge at 37 percent.

00:14:16.129 --> 00:14:17.563
Fire.

00:14:17.563 --> 00:14:19.165
Insufficient charge.

00:14:19.165 --> 00:14:20.867
I said fire! Hurry!

00:14:20.867 --> 00:14:22.061
Firing.

00:14:32.145 --> 00:14:33.680
Don't get in my way!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.850
I will get in your way. I will not
let you shoot Miss Accela.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.118
Do you seriously mean that?

00:14:39.118 --> 00:14:41.780
Then I'm going to seriously
try to defeat you!

00:14:43.556 --> 00:14:46.992
Then I will seriously try to stop you!

00:14:54.367 --> 00:14:57.036
Commencing recharge.

00:14:57.036 --> 00:15:00.640
Charge at 2, 2.5, 3...

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:06.079
- Rose, I realize you aren't to blame.
- 3.5, 4, 4.5, 5, 5.5...

00:15:06.079 --> 00:15:08.247
- But they're never coming back...
- 3.5, 4, 4.5, 5, 5.5...

00:15:08.247 --> 00:15:11.017
- Not Silvia... And not Celica...
- 3.5, 4, 4.5, 5, 5.5...

00:15:11.017 --> 00:15:15.088
6, 6.5,

00:15:15.088 --> 00:15:19.125
- So I will destroy the RUC
and you along with it.
- 7, 7.5, 8...

00:15:19.125 --> 00:15:20.820
Rose Anderson!

00:15:22.862 --> 00:15:25.592
Why are you doing this, Miss Rose?!

00:15:27.533 --> 00:15:30.770
To prevent the damage
from spreading any further!

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:33.206
Then there must be other ways!

00:15:33.206 --> 00:15:35.766
I simply chose the surest way.

00:15:36.943 --> 00:15:39.445
If you get in my way,
I'll defeat you along with her.

00:15:39.445 --> 00:15:40.913
You are being obstinate!

00:15:40.913 --> 00:15:42.515
This is the only way!

00:15:42.515 --> 00:15:44.183
Shooting Miss Accela?!

00:15:44.183 --> 00:15:48.142
I don't... I don't really want
to do something like this, either!

00:15:51.324 --> 00:15:54.327
I don't want there to be any more victims!

00:15:54.327 --> 00:15:56.863
No more! No more!

00:15:56.863 --> 00:16:00.366
But Silvia and Celica are dead now!

00:16:00.366 --> 00:16:02.535
And look at what happened to Integra, too!

00:16:02.535 --> 00:16:04.696
I can't turn back now!

00:16:08.541 --> 00:16:10.643
That is not true!

00:16:10.643 --> 00:16:15.348
If I stop now, their sacrifices
would have been for nothing!

00:16:15.348 --> 00:16:18.451
That's why I have no choice
but to move forward!

00:16:18.451 --> 00:16:21.120
Why are you so...

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.955
This is my atonement!

00:16:22.955 --> 00:16:25.014
For having let those things happen!

00:16:26.259 --> 00:16:27.660
Miss Rose...

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:28.661
For the longest time,

00:16:28.661 --> 00:16:32.532
I felt the resident registration system
could go to hell.

00:16:32.532 --> 00:16:33.900
I wished it would all fall apart,

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:38.104
so it wouldn't matter who was above
and who was below anymore.

00:16:38.104 --> 00:16:42.442
But no one took me seriously.

00:16:42.442 --> 00:16:46.674
They would only smile noncommitally
and tell me, "That can't be done."

00:16:48.214 --> 00:16:50.516
But Ashley was different!

00:16:50.516 --> 00:16:52.151
He listened to me in earnest.

00:16:52.151 --> 00:16:54.320
He gave it serious thought.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.589
That's why I'm helping Ashley!

00:16:56.589 --> 00:16:58.454
To realize our ideals!

00:16:59.992 --> 00:17:01.461
Then why...

00:17:01.461 --> 00:17:05.198
And to do that, we have to
close our eyes to a few sacrifices!

00:17:05.198 --> 00:17:08.634
Then why are you crying?!

00:17:09.969 --> 00:17:14.307
You have to shed tears
to realize your ideals?!

00:17:14.307 --> 00:17:16.809
That cannot be right!

00:17:16.809 --> 00:17:19.979
Pain comes with the territory
with these things!

00:17:19.979 --> 00:17:22.582
I do not want any part
of such a clever excuse!

00:17:22.582 --> 00:17:25.117
That's what it's like in the adult world!

00:17:25.117 --> 00:17:28.382
Then you need not become
an adult like that!

00:17:33.226 --> 00:17:36.286
You can remain Miss Rose, just as you are!

00:17:39.165 --> 00:17:43.202
I am surround by people
who are dear to me,

00:17:43.202 --> 00:17:46.305
who enjoy the food I cook for them.

00:17:46.305 --> 00:17:49.475
And if that brings smiles to their faces,

00:17:49.475 --> 00:17:52.178
that is all I need to be content.

00:17:52.178 --> 00:17:55.409
That is how I hope my world
will continue to be like.

00:17:57.817 --> 00:18:01.719
Of course, you are a part
of that world, too, Miss Rose.

00:18:09.962 --> 00:18:13.232
And so is Miss Accela.

00:18:13.232 --> 00:18:17.803
Cooking together and having
discussions about cooking...

00:18:17.803 --> 00:18:21.933
It would be so nice to always
have fun like that.

00:18:25.745 --> 00:18:28.915
That is how I feel.

00:18:28.915 --> 00:18:30.983
An ideal like that is...

00:18:30.983 --> 00:18:35.784
Is that not the ideal that you
have worked so hard for, Miss Rose?

00:18:39.325 --> 00:18:41.127
It must have been so painful.

00:18:41.127 --> 00:18:43.262
But it is all right now.

00:18:43.262 --> 00:18:46.356
You need not force yourself
to be someone else.

00:18:49.502 --> 00:18:50.662
Miss Rose...

00:18:52.004 --> 00:18:53.699
Welcome back.

00:19:05.885 --> 00:19:07.920
Charge complete.

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:10.356
Proceed with firing sequence.

00:19:10.356 --> 00:19:11.757
I've had enough...

00:19:11.757 --> 00:19:12.625
No more.

00:19:12.625 --> 00:19:15.528
Error. Proceed with firing sequence.

00:19:15.528 --> 00:19:18.064
I won't fire. I...

00:19:18.064 --> 00:19:20.533
Releasing safety.

00:19:20.533 --> 00:19:21.500
What?

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:23.202
No! That can't be!

00:19:23.202 --> 00:19:25.705
- Do as I say!
- Firing.

00:19:25.705 --> 00:19:27.406
No!

00:19:27.406 --> 00:19:29.397
Get away!!

00:20:03.075 --> 00:20:05.311
A-Are we saved?

00:20:05.311 --> 00:20:06.212
Seems that way...

00:20:06.212 --> 00:20:07.907
No, not yet.

00:20:13.052 --> 00:20:15.077
I don't believe it! They don't give up!

00:20:21.093 --> 00:20:22.617
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.901
Is it over?

00:20:28.901 --> 00:20:29.868
Yeah.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:33.906
I see.

00:20:33.906 --> 00:20:37.637
Let's go. There's no reason to stay.

00:20:40.846 --> 00:20:44.650
He'll be okay.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:45.618
Isn't that right?

00:20:45.618 --> 00:20:47.620
Old Man...

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:51.691
Damn right! He is, after all, my big bro!

00:20:51.691 --> 00:20:53.826
That's right.

00:20:53.826 --> 00:20:55.461
Let's get going!

00:20:55.461 --> 00:20:56.860
Rose's place is next.

00:21:00.866 --> 00:21:03.869
So you were the intruders.

00:21:03.869 --> 00:21:06.906
I see. It was Joseph, wasn't it?

00:21:06.906 --> 00:21:11.043
There should be no way to stop Eunomia
using only the subsystem.

00:21:11.043 --> 00:21:13.813
He must have used some trick.

00:21:13.813 --> 00:21:16.509
And here I thought I had killed him.

00:21:21.087 --> 00:21:24.590
I never imagined you would
stop Eunomia for me.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:31.393
Should I thank you, or should I kill you
for doing the unexpected?

00:21:51.514 --> 00:21:56.286
Hareta hi no kouen

00:21:56.286 --> 00:21:59.222
Miageta sora ni

00:21:59.222 --> 00:22:07.994
Kiesou ni natta chiisana Little Cloud

00:22:10.500 --> 00:22:15.271
Kaze ni mi o makasete

00:22:15.271 --> 00:22:18.207
Jiyuu ni ikiru

00:22:18.207 --> 00:22:24.612
Sukoshi-zutsu aruku watashi-tachi

00:22:26.249 --> 00:22:29.275
Onnaji dane

00:22:31.020 --> 00:22:35.758
Taisetsu na jikan

00:22:35.758 --> 00:22:39.595
Deau tabi ni

00:22:39.595 --> 00:22:49.138
Hitori ja nai kono kimochi
yasashisa ni naru

00:22:49.138 --> 00:22:55.745
Dareka o shinjiru yuuki ni kaete

00:22:55.745 --> 00:23:07.521
Kitto kono mama
ano sora no hate ni kieru mae ni

00:23:14.497 --> 00:23:16.599
Is that what you want?

00:23:16.599 --> 00:23:19.535
That is my wish.

00:23:19.535 --> 00:23:22.338
Next time, "Final Message".

00:23:22.338 --> 00:23:24.533
I shall fulfill my promise.
